{"3296260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cafe DReAMLAND", "steam_appid": 3296260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3453340], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/a64c3d20b7455ce3711dd4b40feb7766.avif?t=1747218917\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras_big/a64c3d20b7455ce3711dd4b40feb7766.avif?t=1747218917 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/092aa149b21b3f95c35b11820b55f240.webp?t=1747218917\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe clerk Yatsume has one job: To make drinks for the strange &quot;customers&quot; that stop by the cafe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just any drinks, though: have a wish? With just a hint of blasphemy, these drinks can help make it &quot;come true&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange? Maybe. For Yatsume, though, that's just business as usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, after a certain someone drops by for a special visit, Yatsume comes to learn about the secret behind the shop, and the truth behind the whole world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/34062fa99a9d0620186c6ae11cbd5ab1.webp?t=1747218917\" width=540 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/efe5354efa760a36e922fb5705fba9f8.poster.avif?t=1747218917\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/efe5354efa760a36e922fb5705fba9f8.webm?t=1747218917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/efe5354efa760a36e922fb5705fba9f8.mp4?t=1747218917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grant your &quot;customers&quot; wishes by serving them drinks mixed with a hint of blasphemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From regulars to newcomers, while you might find your &quot;customers&quot; a bit strange, all of them need a little help getting back on the right track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which paths will they ultimately go down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That all depends on your drinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/5c459491c90f0b6afcb090f869e91045.webp?t=1747218917\" width=510 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange, blasphemous ADV game paying respects to Cthulhu mythos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe simulation x Exploration x Multiple endings Let your choices decide the final outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game is an &quot;ADV game meant to pay respects to Cthulhu mythos&quot;, meaning that the characters, places, and events are meant to grab inspiration from the world of Cthulhu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not guarantee that any entities or creatures from Cthulhu mythos are featured within this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters, places, and events are unique to this work, and have no direct relation to the original books, the original characters or the tabletop game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can still be played without any prior knowledge of Cthulhu lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game contains mature themes including, but not limited to, death, bullying, abuse, mental disorders, and fictitious religions; as well as visuals that may be disturbing to some players such as grotesque imagery, blood, and glitching effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/e91f2d556f46128d7f56d23d8158536b.webp?t=1747218917\" width=20 height=16 /></span>Original Soundtrack:ruha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/2c918d3c62d959cd0ee670711984a338.webp?t=1747218917\" width=20 height=22 /></span>English Translation:Meika</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/05a989437924174a7e0cd50bfb84cc0d.avif?t=1747218917\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras_big/05a989437924174a7e0cd50bfb84cc0d.avif?t=1747218917 width=800 height=120 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras/a64c3d20b7455ce3711dd4b40feb7766.avif?t=1747218917\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296260/extras_big/a64c3d20b7455ce3711dd4b40feb7766.avif?t=1747218917 width=800 height=160 /></span></p